Add an authentication check at the beginning of the function to ensure that only authenticated users can access this endpoint. This could be done by checking if `req.user` is present or by using a middleware like `passport.authenticate`. For example:

```javascript
exports.getLoginByEmail = async (req, res, next) => {
  if (!req.isAuthenticated()) {
    return res.redirect('/login');
  }
  // Existing code...
};
```
This will ensure that only authenticated users can access the login verification endpoint.
